        "# @title Setup Nix {display-mode: \"form\"}\n",
        "# @markdown <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NixOS/nixos-artwork/51a27e4a011e95cb559e37d32c44cf89b50f5154/logo/nix-snowflake-colours.svg\" width=\"32\"/>\n",
